  "trees": [
    {
      "id": "a_bare_price_formula_is_live",
      "ast": {
        "type": "op",
        "name": ">",
        "args": [
          {
            "type": "series",
            "name": "close"
          },
          {
            "type": "call",
            "name": "sma",
            "args": [
              {
                "type": "series",
                "name": "close"
              },
              {
                "type": "num",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "freshness": "live",
      "repaint": "non-repainting",
      "scalars": [],
      "why": "THE CONTROL. No leaf is a scalar, so the formula is as fresh as the bar it draws on. Without a case like this `live` would be a value nothing ever emits, and a reader that returned `as-of-snapshot` unconditionally would pass every other case in this file."
    },
    {
      "id": "the_headline__a_scalar_is_non_repainting_AND_as_of_snapshot",
      "ast": {
        "type": "op",
        "name": ">",
        "args": [
          {
            "type": "series",
            "name": "market_cap"
          },
          {
            "type": "num",
            "value": 1000000000.0
          }
        ]
      },
      "freshness": "as-of-snapshot",
      "repaint": "non-repainting",
      "scalars": [
        "market_cap"
      ],
      "why": "\u2b50\u2b50 THE POINT OF THE WHOLE TASK, AND THE ZERO IS THE POINT. `astReach` answers (0, 0) for a scalar leaf, so the repaint gate brands this `non-repainting` -- CORRECTLY, because a per-symbol number depends on no later bar. Which means the repaint gate PASSES a value that is up to a day old and nothing else fires. Both verdicts are asserted on the same tree here so neither can be obtained without the other."
    },
    {
      "id": "one_scalar_anywhere_in_the_tree_dates_the_whole_formula",
      "ast": {
        "type": "op",
        "name": "&&",
        "args": [
          {
            "type": "op",
            "name": ">",
            "args": [
              {
                "type": "series",
                "name": "close"
              },
              {
                "type": "call",
                "name": "sma",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "type": "series",
                    "name": "close"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "num",
                    "value": 20
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "op",
            "name": ">",
            "args": [
              {
                "type": "series",
                "name": "rs_rank"
              },
              {
                "type": "num",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "freshness": "as-of-snapshot",
      "repaint": "non-repainting",
      "scalars": [
        "rs_rank"
      ],
      "why": "A formula is only as fresh as its stalest leaf. A live price condition ANDed with a nightly rank is a nightly answer, and a reader that took the majority of its leaves would call this live."
    },
    {
      "id": "two_scalars_from_the_two_as_of_families",
      "ast": {
        "type": "op",
        "name": "&&",
        "args": [
          {
            "type": "op",
            "name": ">",
            "args": [
              {
                "type": "series",
                "name": "market_cap"
              },
              {
                "type": "num",
                "value": 1000000000.0
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "op",
            "name": ">",
            "args": [
              {
                "type": "series",
                "name": "adr_pct"
              },
              {
                "type": "num",
                "value": 4.0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "freshness": "as-of-snapshot",
      "repaint": "non-repainting",
      "scalars": [
        "adr_pct",
        "market_cap"
      ],
      "why": "`market_cap` is dated `snapshot_date` and `adr_pct` is dated `bars_asof` -- two DIFFERENT dates in one formula, which is why the badge names a cadence class and never a date. A single as-of would over-claim one family or under-claim the other."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_scalar_deep_inside_a_call_is_still_found",
      "ast": {
        "type": "op",
        "name": ">",
        "args": [
          {
            "type": "call",
            "name": "abs",
            "args": [
              {
                "type": "series",
                "name": "chg_pct_1d"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "num",
            "value": 3.0
          }
        ]
      },
      "freshness": "as-of-snapshot",
      "repaint": "non-repainting",
      "scalars": [
        "chg_pct_1d"
      ],
      "why": "The walk is over the WHOLE tree, not over its root's direct arguments. A reader that only looked one level down reports `live` here and the badge is a lie in the direction that matters."
    },
